;<br></li><li> More than 20 handcrafted levels with increasing difficulty (cabins, engine zone, casino, park, restaurants, and more);<br></li><li> Thriller element - you can find out who is guilty of causing this catastrophe;<br></li><li> The end of the game depends on your decisions;</li></ul>",
